@startuml fig_freshness_timeline
!include _style.puml
' Book figure — the strict-after-acknowledgement contract placed on one timeline.
' Form: timeline. Evidence status: conceptual illustration — it draws the contract
' the measured claims are judged against (v2-16, v3-04, v3-05) and asserts no rate.
title the strict-after-acknowledgement contract, on one timeline

participant "writer W" as W
participant "source" as DB
participant "reader R" as R

W -> DB : write W1
DB --> W : commit
W -> R : ack(W1) observed
R -> DB : begin(R1)
note over W, R
  The contract binds here and not before:
  begin(R1) > ack(W1) implies R1 must not
  return a version older than W1, unless a
  later write to the key supersedes it.
end note
note over DB
  Every relaxed contract is a named
  weakening of that line; bounded staleness
  adds a declared delta to it, and the
  measured relaxed cells declare no delta.
end note
@enduml
